  "recipe": "A shared task board for putting out an issue of a zine. Every card sits in one of four columns — To do, Doing, Blocked, Done — and the column is a single value the whole group shares, so anyone can move any card and the last move wins. Moving a card also puts the mover's marker on it, one marker per person, so the board shows where everybody is. The cards are fixed by whoever sets the board up; members move them but do not add their own. Column names and card names are permanent once the board is running, because every card already on the board is stored under them."
